    {
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "_key": "beliefs-membership",
      "anchor": {
        "_type": "slug",
        "current": "membership"
      },
      "heading": "Membership",
      "width": "narrow",
      "body": [
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-h1",
          "style": "h3",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-h1s1",
              "text": "Full Member",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-a-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-a-1s1",
              "text": "To join Muncie First Baptist Church people normally present themselves for membership by coming forward at the end of a worship service when the pastor invites people to join the church.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-b-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-b-1s1",
              "text": "Any person who professes faith in Jesus Christ as Lord and Savior may be admitted for membership by making your profession of faith in Jesus Christ public and following that with baptism, by transferring your membership from another church or by stating that you are a Christian and have been a member of a church, but for some reason transfer of a letter from that church is unlikely.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-c-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-c-1s1",
              "text": "If you were baptized as an infant, our membership form may ask if you have taken any form of confirmation class.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-h2",
          "style": "h3",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-h2s1",
              "text": "Associate Member",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-d-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-d-1s1",
              "text": "Any believer who is temporarily living in the Muncie community may unite with Muncie First Baptist Church during their stay in Muncie and retain membership in their home church.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-e-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-e-1s1",
              "text": "Traditionally, college students have joined as associate members.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-f-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-f-1s1",
              "text": "An Associate Member has no vote on church matters and may not hold elected positions, but may attend church meetings, may assume some positions of leadership, and is invited to participate in all church activities. Such membership terminates upon completion of their temporary stay.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "mb-g-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_key": "mb-g-1l1",
              "href": "#documents"
            }
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-g-1s1",
              "text": "For more information see ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-g-1s2",
              "text": "our Constitution and Bylaws",
              "marks": [
                "mb-g-1l1"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "mb-g-1s3",
              "text": ".",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "_key": "beliefs-covenant",
      "heading": "Our Church Covenant",
      "width": "narrow",
      "body": [
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-a-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-a-1s1",
              "text": "We, the members of this church, through the grace of God, humbly and solemnly undertake with His aid:",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-1s1",
              "text": "To attend the worship and services of this church regularly, using them for the edification of our souls.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-2",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-2s1",
              "text": "To contribute cheerfully and regularly to the financial support of the work of this church and its various beneficences.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-3",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-3s1",
              "text": "To aid and assist prayerfully, loyally, and willingly, the minister and those who work with him [or her] in the witness of this church.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-4",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-4s1",
              "text": "To maintain, in all our relations with our fellow members, an attitude of spiritual integrity, sympathy, and love.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-5",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-5s1",
              "text": "To cooperate with interest and earnestness in the redemptive, missionary, and social tasks of the Kingdom of God.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-6",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-6s1",
              "text": "To cultivate by prayer and meditation a life of devotion and consecration to God and to our Savior, Jesus Christ.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-7",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-7s1",
              "text": "To aspire, in our private lives, to character and conduct that shall be approved by God and our consciences.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-8",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-8s1",
              "text": "To order the life in our homes so that they may be truly Christian and dwelling places of God.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-b-9",
          "style": "normal",
          "listItem": "bullet",
          "level": 1,
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-b-9s1",
              "text": "To bear ourselves in our social and business interrelationships in accordance with the principles of Jesus Christ.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-c-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-c-1s1",
              "text": "We enter this covenant inspired by devoted love to Him who gave Himself for our salvation. We seek that communion of our spirits with His, so graciously bestowed on us. We desire to serve Him and those who are in the work of His hand. We pray for Divine guidance and help in this our earnest endeavor.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "cv-d-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "cv-d-1s1",
              "text": "We further engage that when we remove from this place, we will, as soon as possible, unite with some other Church where we can carry out the spirit of this Covenant and the principles of God’s word.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "richTextSection",
      "_key": "beliefs-affiliation",
      "heading": "Our Baptist Affiliation",
      "width": "narrow",
      "body": [
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "af-a-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_key": "af-a-1l1",
              "href": "https://www.abc-usa.org/"
            },
            {
              "_type": "link",
              "_key": "af-a-1l2",
              "href": "https://abc-indiana.org/"
            }
          ],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "af-a-1s1",
              "text": "We are affiliated with the ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "af-a-1s2",
              "text": "American Baptist Churches - USA",
              "marks": [
                "af-a-1l1"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "af-a-1s3",
              "text": " and the ",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "af-a-1s4",
              "text": "American Baptist Churches of Indiana and Kentucky",
              "marks": [
                "af-a-1l2"
              ]
            },
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "af-a-1s5",
              "text": ".",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "af-b-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "af-b-1s1",
              "text": "American Baptists are a Christ-centered, biblically grounded, ethnically diverse people called to radical personal discipleship in Christ Jesus.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "block",
          "_key": "af-c-1",
          "style": "normal",
          "markDefs": [],
          "children": [
            {
              "_type": "span",
              "_key": "af-c-1s1",
              "text": "American Baptists' commitment to Jesus propels us to nurture authentic relationships with one another; build healthy churches; transform our communities, our nations, and our world; engage every member in hands-on ministry; and speak the prophetic word in love.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
